@OrdersApi = http://localhost:6002
@CustomerId = invitado
@OrderId = REEMPLAZAR_CON_ID
@IdempotencyKey = demo-order-001

### Crear una orden válida (P1)
POST {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}

{
  "customerId": "{{CustomerId}}",
  "basketId": "{{CustomerId}}"
}

### Repetir la misma clave: devuelve la orden existente (P4)
POST {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{IdempotencyKey}}

{
  "customerId": "{{CustomerId}}",
  "basketId": "{{CustomerId}}"
}

### Consultar una orden (P2)
GET {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders/{{OrderId}}

### Consultar órdenes por cliente
GET {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders/customer/{{CustomerId}}

### Confirmar una orden (P5)
PATCH {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders/{{OrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### Cancelar una orden Pending
PATCH {{OrdersApi}}/api/orders/{{OrderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}
